      "retrieved": "2026-08-11",
      "notes": "The AFH presents procedures as prose text. Conversion to challenge/response format is an editorial act by the transcriber. The Handbook's own before-takeoff numbered question list is preserved in the before-takeoff section; items that are phrased as questions in the source are rendered as action/response pairs. All numeric values are placeholders; the pilot must consult their aircraft's AFM/POH for specific limits."
    },
